  "note": "Content digests of everything that decides whether the test suite runs, and of the suites themselves. A TRIPWIRE WITH NO SELF-ANCHOR: a commit updating a file and its digest together passes, confirmed by independent review as a fixed-point property of a repository where one commit can change every file. Separately, a trailing '&' in package.json's check script backgrounds the whole chain so `npm run check` returns 0 before any step's exit code matters -- NO in-script control can prevent that, and the digest does not help because the exit code is already 0. The caller must invoke the guard as its own step. Both anchors are outside: human review of the diff (RFC-2026-002) and protected CI, an open Gate G0 requirement.",
